      "message": "I\u0027m thinking the case host app has to receive both success signal and unexpected close event in setup FAILURE case.\n\n1. host app is blocked in accept()\n2. host stack sends success signal to BluetoothSocket because we assume it would be success\n3. host app is unblocked from accept() and it starts additional procedure for OOB communication with offload app\n4. setup FAILURE is reported from offload domain\n5. host stack close the socket \n6. host app is notified for the unexpected disconnection",
